abstract: >-
  Data and code behind the post 'Solar drag is uninsurable': satellite lifetime runs under
  storms and a stronger or weaker solar cycle, the 128 published forecasts of Cycle 25, and
  the sunspot record, showing why drag from the solar cycle cannot be insured.
